  "chp.intro_a": "Aegis tells the owner (and the log channel) when admins or their rights change, the title or photo changes, a post is edited, or Aegis's own rights change. Telegram doesn't tell bots when posts are deleted.",
  "chp.intro_d": "The group where the channel's comments are. Its locks and security are its own (open its panel); here are the protections for comments.",
  "chp.intro_e": "A footer and link buttons added to every new post, posts that delete themselves, and options for posts published through Aegis.",
  "chp.intro_h": "If the channel accepts direct messages, Aegis can remove spam there: blocked senders, links, scams and dangerous files, known fakes and floods, and decline suggested posts with links.",
  "chp.intro_i": "Links made here show how many joined or asked through each one. (Telegram doesn't let bots list links made elsewhere.)",
  "chp.intro_j": "Checks for every request: blacklist, known fakes, suspicious names and bios, bursts; then a captcha (if on) and the rule below. Requests Aegis received are listed for the admins.",
