  "sec.d_quarantine": "Newcomers can only send text (or nothing) for a while after joining. Telegram lifts it by itself when the time is up.",
  "sec.d_raid": "Notices a raid — many joins at once — and switches on raid mode for a while: a captcha or quarantine for newcomers, an emergency lock, or just an alert.",
  "sec.d_risk": "Adds up the signals of a message or a newcomer into a score, explains it, alerts the admins and acts above the threshold. ✅/❌ on each alert teaches the weights for this group.",
